\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Overall architecture of the proposed Sim-to-Real quadrupedal navigation framework. (a) In the virtual validation stage, we reconstruct a 3DGS environment and train an RL locomotion policy to simulate camera bobbing noise. (b) In the physical deployment stage, the RL policy is bypassed, and commands are sent to the Unitree Sport API via a ROS 2 bridge to reduce computational load on the Jetson Orin NX.}}{3}{}\protected@file@percent }
